ST09U4jHfR23Htd9HjHGYARZcB3Pzma3Vo0XVQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1274\" style=\"\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">4，资源股里石油走的最好。煤炭有色暂时都是震荡，甚至偏弱势。想布局资源股可以重点做石油。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">5，券商大涨要等大盘走主升浪才行，还需要时间。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">今天券商虽然涨了，但现在技术面还是震荡，而且今天上涨的几个龙头都放量开板了，短期可能没有持续性，有点耐心就好。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"0.7326732673267327\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMPz4osPcmoCR0GueHbqw99O6qBuuz94l16ZR29mxsnuibALaBOUCPvhGFCyLyay5yLKcmZTIsbtYicQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"909\" style=\"\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br/></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"align-items: center;display: flex;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;flex: 1 0 1px;letter-spacing: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5em;margin-bottom: 0.5em;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(62, 62, 62);box-sizing: border-box;\"><svg style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;f